{
 "schema": "narrative.taunts/1",
 "_about": "DRAFT, unwired. The shape for the taunt director (docs/narrative/taunt-system.md) and the first batch of lines, all placeholders for Orb's edit (voice-lab/taunts-draft.csv). The ids match the CSV. Not in data/narrative yet: moving it there needs a schema in tools/schemas. Unsearched by Legal.",
