   "fighter": "PROTAGONIST",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Show me something.",
   "words": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-pro-037",
   "fighter": "PROTAGONIST",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Do you want a turn?",
   "words": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-pro-038",
   "fighter": "PROTAGONIST",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Come and get it.",
   "words": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-pro-039",
   "fighter": "PROTAGONIST",
   "tier": "tag",
   "family": "tag",
   "text": "Friend.",
   "words": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-pro-040",
   "fighter": "PROTAGONIST",
   "tier": "tag",
   "family": "tag",
   "text": "Champ.",
   "words": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-001",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "You may begin whenever you wish. It will not help.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "rung": "1"
   },
   "opens": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-002",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "I have been waiting. You were late.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "rung": "1"
   },
   "opens": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-003",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Still standing there. You were always good at that.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "rung": "2-3"
   },
   "opens": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-004",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "That is twice. I have not moved either.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "2-3"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-005",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "You were never this patient. Fifth. Behind the goons.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "rung": "4-6"
   },
   "opens": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-006",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Do try something. Anything. I will pretend to be surprised.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "rung": "4-6"
   },
   "opens": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-007",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "I have stood here so long my regalia has gone out of fashion.",
   "words": 13,
   "when": {
    "rung": "7-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-008",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "This is beneath us both. Mostly you.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "rung": "7-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-009",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "A statue could have won this by now.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "13+"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-010",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Last. Behind the furniture, and the floor it stands on.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "rung": "13+"
   },
   "opens": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-011",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Ten. You were exactly that predictable.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 10
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-012",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Twenty-five. Even the goons would have left.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 25
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-013",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Fifty. Tell no one I stayed.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 50
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-014",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "A hundred. I was never here.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 100
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-015",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "You were never going to keep up.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "standing": "ahead"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-016",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "I am behind. Notice how little it matters.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "standing": "behind"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-017",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "A fine hole. You dug it. You will lie in it.",
   "words": 11,
   "when": {
    "event": "crater"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-018",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "They ran. You ran after them. Filth.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "collateral": "many"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-019",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Your {part} was your best feature. It was.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "wound": "opp"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-020",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "A scratch. You were always fond of scratches.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "wound": "self"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-021",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "You have grown. You were small before.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "tier": "opp_higher"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-022",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "The sea. Fitting. You were always shallow.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "biome": "ocean"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-023",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Do you still believe you will fix it?",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "vs": "protagonist"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-024",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "The hat is crooked. I noticed.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "vs": "empress"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-025",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "I am not hungry. You were.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "vs": "cyborg"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-026",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "I do not come when called. I arrive.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-027",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "Insult me better. You were better.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-028",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "Spare me. Your pity was always cheap.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "pity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-029",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "takeoff",
   "text": "Enough. Watch.",
   "words": 2,
   "when": {
    "ended": "takeoff"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-030",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Well?",
   "words": 1,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-031",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Slow.",
   "words": 1,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-032",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Again.",
   "words": 1,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-033",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "You are standing very still.",
   "words": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-034",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "A nice crater.",
   "words": 3,
   "when": {
    "event": "crater"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-035",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "That was a cheap hit.",
   "words": 5,
   "when": {
    "event": "hit_taken"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-036",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "I was told you would be harder.",
   "words": 7
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-037",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Do try to impress me.",
   "words": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-038",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "I have seen goons fight better.",
   "words": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-039",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "tag",
   "family": "tag",
   "text": "Filth.",
   "words": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-ant-040",
   "fighter": "ANTIHERO",
   "tier": "tag",
   "family": "tag",
   "text": "Fifth.",
   "words": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-001",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Petitioner, the queue begins here.",
   "words": 5,
   "when": {
    "rung": "1"
   },
   "opens": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-002",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "We are accepting submissions. Guard, take a note.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "1"
   },
   "opens": [
    "stall"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-003",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "We are being very patient. Guard, record it.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "2-3"
   },
   "opens": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-004",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Another taunt? We keep a tally. In triplicate.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "2-3"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-005",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Guard, the petitioner has been standing there a full minute. Minute it.",
   "words": 12,
   "when": {
    "rung": "4-6"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-006",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "How tedious. We were promised violence.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "rung": "4-6"
   },
   "opens": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-007",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Guard, bring a chair. It is a long session.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "rung": "7-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-008",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "We have run out of insults. A first. File it.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "rung": "7-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-009",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "We shall have this stand-off declared a province.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "13+"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-010",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "At this rate the hat will be out of fashion.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "rung": "13+"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-011",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "That is ten, petitioner. We have a form for ten.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 10
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-012",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Twenty-five! We shall have to open a new file.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 25
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-013",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Fifty. We have stood here so long we have become an annex.",
   "words": 12,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 50
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-014",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "A hundred. We name this field after ourselves.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 100
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-015",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "You are behind, petitioner. We are very ahead. Do try to keep up.",
   "words": 13,
   "when": {
    "standing": "ahead"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-016",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "We are behind. It is a clerical error.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "standing": "behind"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-017",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "A crater! We shall put a fountain in it.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "event": "crater"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-018",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Look at the skyline, guard. We were here.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "collateral": "many"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-019",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Your {part}! How quaint. Have it filed.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "wound": "opp"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-020",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "You struck our {part}. We shall mention it.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "wound": "self"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-021",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "A new revision of you? How inferior.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "tier": "opp_higher"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-022",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Guard, the petitioner is looking at you. Look back.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "guard": "alive"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-023",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Do not promise to fix us, petitioner.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "vs": "protagonist"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-024",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Sulk louder, petitioner. We cannot hear you from the throne.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "vs": "anti_hero"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-025",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Do not eat the guard. We need them for the parade.",
   "words": 11,
   "when": {
    "vs": "cyborg"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-026",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "We do not go to petitioners. Petitioners come to us.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-027",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "How rude. Say it again, slower, for the minutes.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-028",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "Pity us? We are the empire.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "pity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-029",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "takeoff",
   "text": "Enough. The empire advances.",
   "words": 4,
   "when": {
    "ended": "takeoff"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-030",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Well, petitioner?",
   "words": 2,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-031",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "How dull.",
   "words": 2,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-032",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Guard, note that.",
   "words": 3,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-033",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "Your stance is irregular.",
   "words": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-034",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "We rather like the crater.",
   "words": 5,
   "when": {
    "event": "crater"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-035",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "The guard is watching.",
   "words": 4,
   "when": {
    "guard": "alive"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-036",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Do try to be interesting.",
   "words": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-037",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "We expected a better petition.",
   "words": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-038",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Come, impress us.",
   "words": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-039",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "tag",
   "family": "tag",
   "text": "Petitioner.",
   "words": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-emp-040",
   "fighter": "EMPRESS",
   "tier": "tag",
   "family": "tag",
   "text": "Do carry on.",
   "words": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-001",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Welcome. Do take a seat. Any seat.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "rung": "1"
   },
   "opens": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-002",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Your table will be ready shortly.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "rung": "1"
   },
   "opens": [
    "stall"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-003",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Thank you for waiting. It is nearly your turn.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "rung": "2-3"
   },
   "opens": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-004",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "May I take your order? It is optional.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "2-3"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-005",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "The wait is now six minutes. Complimentary bread.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "rung": "4-6"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-006",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Sir, the menu is still open.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "rung": "4-6"
   },
   "opens": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-007",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "We have been open an hour. One customer. You.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "rung": "7-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-008",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "Please, sir. A man must eat.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "rung": "7-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-009",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "The kitchen is closing. It has been closing for an hour.",
   "words": 11,
   "when": {
    "rung": "13+"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-010",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "ladder",
   "text": "I have started on the tablecloth.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "rung": "13+"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-011",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Ten! You qualify for a loyalty card.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 10
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-012",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Twenty-five visits. A free drink. A free you.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 25
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-013",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "Fifty. You are a regular. I know your order.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 50
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-014",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "milestone",
   "text": "A hundred. We shall name a dish after you.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "standoff_count": 100
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-015",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "You are doing wonderfully, sir. Do keep not winning.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "standing": "ahead"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-016",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "I am behind. It is only the starter.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "standing": "behind"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-017",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "A crater! A new prep bowl.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "event": "crater"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-018",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Look at all the customers. Left in a hurry.",
   "words": 9,
   "when": {
    "collateral": "many"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-019",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Sir, your {part} looks tender. Very tender.",
   "words": 7,
   "when": {
    "wound": "opp"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-020",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "N-n-not the {part}. It is a seasonal part.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "wound": "self"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-021",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "A bigger portion! How considerate.",
   "words": 5,
   "when": {
    "tier": "opp_higher"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-022",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "I do like a harbour. It is where the food arrives.",
   "words": 11,
   "when": {
    "biome": "harbour"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-023",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "The special today is you, sir. With sincerity.",
   "words": 8,
   "when": {
    "vs": "protagonist"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-024",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Sir, you are frowning at the menu. It is not that bad.",
   "words": 12,
   "when": {
    "vs": "anti_hero"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-025",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "react",
   "text": "Madam, your party is very well dressed. I have not eaten in a while.",
   "words": 14,
   "when": {
    "vs": "empress"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-026",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "Certainly, sir. One moment while I come to the table.",
   "words": 10,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "dare"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-027",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "Feedback noted. Do continue.",
   "words": 4,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "needle"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-028",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "answer",
   "text": "Pity? I would prefer a tip.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "taunted_back": true
   },
   "replies_to": [
    "pity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-029",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "takeoff",
   "text": "Your order is on its way.",
   "words": 6,
   "when": {
    "ended": "takeoff"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-030",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Order up?",
   "words": 2,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-031",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Sir?",
   "words": 1,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-032",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "whole",
   "family": "short",
   "text": "Any time.",
   "words": 2,
   "when": {
    "tempo": "mashed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-033",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "I see you have chosen to stand.",
   "words": 7
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-034",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "A fine crater, sir.",
   "words": 4,
   "when": {
    "event": "crater"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-035",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "hook",
   "family": "hook",
   "text": "The kitchen is watching.",
   "words": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-036",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
   "tier": "jab",
   "family": "jab",
   "text": "Shall I bring the starters?",
   "words": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "tnt-cyb-037",
   "fighter": "CYBORG",
